coalesce over a computed primary that reads only fields 0.0 always has: the
fallback could never apply.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	count: int32
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	total: int64
}

ForwardLens: (prev): {
	self: {
		total: _coalesce(prev.count * 2, 0)
		count: _drop
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	total: int64
}
-- out/error --
error[E0348]: v0.0 always has every field prev.count * 2 reads, so _coalesce's fallback could never apply
